  "limitations": [
    "Complete principal irregular castle ring with its actual open courtyard,main entrance passage,gilded courtyard-side dome,green west dome,four tall outer round towers,two court turrets,northeastern chapel/bay,stepped roof gables and chimney silhouettes. Independent lower orangery and island terrace/bridge/garden structures remain native context.",
