    "Approximate47m sea-level datum from unmodified standard129x129/2m global viewer field. Exterior foundations sample field-.35m;entrance floor follows field+.12m. Original photo-proportional main eaves23.6-25.2m/roofs31-33m;outer towers~42m,great garden tower~52m,gilded dome figure~49m. Native height tags inform silhouettes but are not surveyed. No island flattening.",
    "Ordinary pictures plus standard PMTiles/global terrain only. Fine window/gable/chimney/sculpture inventories,roof junctions,exact foundations/historic threshold/accessibility levels approximate. Original simplified figure/equestrian silhouettes do not copy sculpture or lettering. Closed panes/doors exclude optical interiors. Independent orangery,bridges,terrace/garden retaining walls and island landscaping excluded and preserved. No private/embedded images. Physical laptop/phone/dense-city timing unmeasured.",
    "Seven existing256px shared sandstone,limestone,brick,slate,painted-metal,window-grid andpainted-wood graphs;metric UVs/linear colors. Skyline preserves the principal open court,gate,tall towers andtwo contrasting domes without small windows. District keeps sparse glazing andselected gables;street adds flat frames andnine turret silhouettes;close-up has physical border frames anddenser tower/gable profiles;master keeps finer mullions/profiles andmore gables. Subpixel small court/chapel turrets omitted from skyline/district. Error estimates4/2/1/.3m are not measured mesh distances. No physical device timing."
  ],
